						 <p>Dear Diary:</p> <p>Today I met this cute girl named Iris. I wonder if she has a crush on me too? Somehow, this kind of writing is convincing for any personnel associated with the Foundation, so maybe that will help my chances. I also met Josie the Half-cat today, she was sooo cute!</p> <p>- Creepy Speedo Guy</p> 
