					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-96001#post-1829736</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-96001/personal-log-of-agent-aa#post-1829736</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2013 18:52:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Djoric</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>388108</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>was in fact dressed up like a video game character (whom I later found out was J███ from &quot;██████ ████ ███ ████&quot;)</p> </blockquote> <p>It's Jade. From <em>Beyond Good and Evil.</em> A game far too good to be referenced by this garbage. Need a bit better of an excuse than it being Halloween.</p> <p>Then we get the ridiculous unnecessary censorship, tacticool nonsense out the wazoo, &quot;oh look Able is so kewl&quot;, lack of any interesting prose, characters, or sense of logic. (Without any outside reason for said lack of logic)</p> <p>This is adolescent power fantasy tripe.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
