					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-96001#post-294401</guid>
				<title>Re:</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-96001/personal-log-of-agent-aa#post-294401</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2008 07:52:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>I Am A Potato</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>215808</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>See, that's the thing, the timing of everything, and your log just lays it all out so beautifully (Cain's cryptic message, recapturing Iris, the retrieval of Steel Doll, etc.) that I think it would just be better for me to place Wanderlust after it in continuity, and as such change those two characters.</p> <p>Besides, the Steel Doll incident is cited at the beginning of Dr. Bishop's journal, and then <em>his</em> death is cited at the beginning of Wanderlust. So there's really no way to put those events before or else we get a nasty little temporal loop.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
